   F08 Metal surface,       !- Name
   Smooth,                  !- Roughness
   0.0008,                  !- Thickness {m}
   45.28,                   !- Conductivity {W/m-K}
   7824.0,                  !- Density {kg/m3}
   500.0;                   !- Specific Heat {J/kg-K}

